Description: Provides a tidy API to the open data published by the
    Brazilian Securities and Exchange Commission ('CVM' - Comissao de
    Valores Mobiliarios). The package's first release covers core
    publicly-traded-company datasets: 'cad' (company registry), 'itr'
    (quarterly financial statements), 'dfp' (annual financial
    statements) and 'fre' (reference form, including ESG/governance
    tables). Column names, table names, categorical values and free
    text are preserved in Portuguese as published by 'CVM'; function
    names, arguments and metadata attributes are in English following
    the rOpenSci and tidyverse conventions. Future releases will
    expand coverage to investment funds and other regulated entity
    classes.
